<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Abyx - Minimalist Landing Page</title>

    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>

    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #ffffff;
            --fg: #1a1a1a;
            --fg-secondary: #525252;
            --accent: #1a1a1a;
            --transition-slow: 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            --transition-normal: 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            --easing: cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--fg);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Smooth scroll */
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(40px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes fadeInLeft {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateX(-60px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes scaleIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: scale(0.95);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            padding: 24px 60px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .logo:hover {
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 48px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--fg-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            position: relative;
            transition: var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .nav-link::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -8px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--fg);
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transition: var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: var(--fg);
        }

        .nav-link:hover::after {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding-left: 60px;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero-text {
            width: 55%;
        }

        .hero-eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: var(--fg);
            color: var(--bg);
            border-radius: 100px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .hero-eyebrow i {
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 82px;
            line-height: 1.05;
            letter-spacing: -3px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.4s both;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: var(--fg-secondary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 500px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.6s both;
        }

        .cta-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
            margin-top: 48px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.8s both;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 16px 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--fg);
            color: var(--bg);
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--fg-secondary);
            border: 2px solid var(--fg-secondary);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: var(--fg-secondary);
            color: var(--bg);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Icon Animation */
        .hero-visual {
            width: 45%;
            height: 60vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: scaleIn 1s ease-out 0.2s both;
        }

        .icon-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 350px;
            height: 350px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .pulse-ring {
            position: absolute;
            border: 2px solid var(--fg);
            border-radius: 100%;
            opacity: 0.3;
            animation: scaleIn 1s ease-out 0.5s both, 
                       pulse-ring 4s ease-in-out infinite 0.8s;
        }

        .pulse-ring:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: 0.8s;
        }

        .pulse-ring:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: 1.6s;
        }

        .main-icon {
            font-size: 140px;
            z-index: 2;
            transition: var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .hero-visual:hover .main-icon {
            transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-5deg);
        }

        /* Features Section */
        .features {
            padding: 140px 60px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 1.5s both;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 48px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            padding: 40px 32px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: #fafafa;
            transition: var(--transition-normal);
            cursor: default;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out both;
        }

        .feature-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

        .feature-card:hover {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            transform: translateY(-8px);
        }

        .feature-icon-wrapper {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: var(--fg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            color: var(--bg);
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        .feature-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .feature-desc {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--fg-secondary);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* Stats Section */
        .stats {
            padding: 100px 60px;
            background: var(--fg);
            color: var(--bg);
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 1.8s both;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-item h3 {
            font-size: 62px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--fg-secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            padding: 60px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 2.2s both;
        }

        .footer-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .footer-logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 32px;
        }

        .social-link {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--fg);
            color: var(--bg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .social-link:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px) rotate(5deg);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            h1 { font-size: 68px; }
            .hero-text, .hero-visual, nav { padding-left: 40px; width: 95%; }
            .hero { flex-wrap: wrap; min-height: auto; height: auto; }
            .hero-text, .hero-visual { width: 100%; text-align: center; justify-content: center; }
            .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            h1 { font-size: 52px; }
            nav { padding: 20px 32px; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .hero-eyebrow, .cta-group { justify-content: center; }
            .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 80px 32px; }
            footer { padding: 40px 32px; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; text-align: center; }
        }

        /* Staggered animations for feature cards */
        @keyframes staggerFadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .feature-card {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out both, 
                       staggerFadeIn 0.4s ease-out forwards;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">ABYX</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
            <a href="#pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
            <a href="#about" class="nav-link">About</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="nav-link">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <span class="hero-eyebrow">
                    <i data-lucide="zap"></i>
                    <span>New: v2.0 Now Live</span>
                </span>
                <h1>Simplify Your<br>Digital Reality.</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    Minimalist design meets maximum impact. Streamline your workflow with an interface that respects both aesthetics and functionality.
                </p>
                <div class="cta-group">
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Watch Demo</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="icon-container">
                    <span class="pulse-ring"></span>
                    <span class="pulse-ring"></span>
                    <span class="pulse-ring"></span>
                    <i data-lucide="cpu" class="main-icon"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Features Section -->
        <section id="features" class="features">
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
                        <i data-lucide="zap"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="feature-title">Lightning Fast</h3>
                    <p class="feature-desc">Optimized for speed with zero latency. Every interaction responds instantly, making your workflow feel seamless.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
                        <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="feature-title">Secure by Design</h3>
                    <p class="feature-desc">Enterprise-grade security built into every layer. Your data is protected with military-standard encryption.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
                        <i data-lucide="layout-grid"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="feature-title">Clean Interface</h3>
                    <p class="feature-desc">A minimalist design that reduces cognitive load. Focus on what matters without visual distractions.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Stats Section -->
        <section class="stats">
            <div class="stats-grid">
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <h3>99.9%</h3>
                    <span class="stat-label">Uptime</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <h3>10M+</h3>
                    <span class="stat-label">Users</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <h3>50ms</h3>
                    <span class="stat-label">Latency</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <h3>24/7</h3>
                    <span class="stat-label">Support</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-logo">ABYX</div>
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#" class="social-link" aria-label="Twitter">
                    <i data-lucide="twitter"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link" aria-label="GitHub">
                    <i data-lucide="github"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link" aria-label="Instagram">
                    <i data-lucide="instagram"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Initialize Lucide Icons -->
    <script>
        lucide.createIcons();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
